OL,3,AFormer DUP leader Jeffrey Donaldson
OL,4,Abeing sentenced for child sex abuse
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe former leader of the Democratic
OL,7,FUnionist Party (DUP), Jeffrey
OL,8,FDonaldson, is being sentenced for a
OL,9,Fseries of child sex offences, including
OL,10,Frape
OL,12,FDonaldson was convicted in June of 18
OL,13,Fcounts of sex abuse, which he committed
OL,14,Fagainst two women when they were
OL,15,Fchildren. The offences occurred between
OL,16,F1985 and 2008
OL,18,FIn July, the 63-year-old - who was an
OL,19,FMP for 27 years, until 2024 - was
OL,20,Fstripped of his knighthood by the King
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,0,100
