OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AFormer DUP leader Jeffrey Donaldson
OL,4,Abeing sentenced for child sex abuse
OL,5,
OL,6,FDonaldson arrived at court this morning
OL,7,Ffrom Maghaberry Prison. Opening the
OL,8,Fsentencing, the judge calls it a
OL,9,F"disturbing and disquieting" case
OL,11,FDonaldson's wife, Eleanor, faced a
OL,12,F"trial of the facts" on mental health
OL,13,Fgrounds, relating to five charges,
OL,14,Fincluding four related to aiding and
OL,15,Fabetting
OL,17,FShe was found to have "done the acts",
OL,18,Fand will hear about any actions taken
OL,19,Fagainst her at a later date
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
